1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[dramatic music playing]

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
[narrator] 30 minutes
after the extermination team

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
launched their offensive,

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
even as the fierce battle unfolded inside,

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
an immense number of citizens

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
who had been hypnotized
by Pouf's wing scales

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
were still lined up beyond the walls

8
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,000
BREAKDOWN X AND X AWAKENING

11
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,000
[electricity crackling]

12
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Someone's watching me, and…

13
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,000
[footsteps pattering]

14
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,000
[gasps]

15
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
If Gon sees what's happened to Palm,

16
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,000
he's not gonna be able to handle it.

17
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
There's no room left inside of his heart,

18
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,000
not for something as awful as this.

19
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,000
[glass shatters]

20
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,000
…Gon could totally lose it.

21
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:48,000
I have to find out right here and now.

22
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:56,000
We still have a chance.
Palm approached me herself.

23
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:23,000
[Killua] I thought she could use
some kind of divination to locate people,

24
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
but it's probably closer to Clairvoyance.

25
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:43,000
And if Palm had changed sides,
she definitely would've backed off.

26
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:57,000
She approached me,
so she must remember me…

27
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,000
Killua, right?

28
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,000
[gasps]

29
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,000
[Killua] I knew it.

30
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,000
She does remember!

31
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,000
[Palm] Where's Gon?

32
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,000
[sighs]

33
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Once he sees what I have become,

34
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
do you think that he's going to hate me?

35
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:31,000
[sighs] Gon doesn't judge people
by their appearances.

36
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:34,000
Also, you're assuming
he liked you in the first place.

37
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:39,000
You always act like
such a spiteful little brat,

38
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,000
now, don't you?

39
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,000
Gon is with Pitou at the moment.

40
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,000
I'm sure he's--

41
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,000
[tense music playing]

42
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,000
So was it just by chance you found me?

43
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:21,000
Huh? What are you talking about?

44
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,000
You were the one who just walked
around the corner and found me.

45
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,000
[Killua] You're wrong. I sensed you.

46
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,000
I felt you watching me,

47
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,000
and that's the reason I came this way.

48
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,000
But I'm sure you noticed me first.

49
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Why are you lying?

50
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:44,000
[Palm] You are such a little pest.

51
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Where is Gon?

52
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Answer me first, and maybe I'll tell you.

53
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Then she used Clairvoyance
to watch me follow her

54
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Where can I find Gon?

55
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,000
I'm not telling you.

56
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
[Killua gasps]

57
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:49,000
[Palm] It seems I've made a mistake.

58
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:54,000
There are better ways to use my abilities.

59
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:14,000
[Killua] Damn. She's dangerous.

60
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:19,000
Better to let everything out,
don't you think?

61
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:23,000
A perfect example of that would be

62
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:26,000
my desire to kill you!

63
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
[laughs]

64
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:50,000
Well? What are you gonna do now?

65
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,000
Will you stay silent?

66
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,000
Give up and talk?

67
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:25,000
[Palm laughing]

68
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,000
[blows striking]

69
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:37,000
[narrator] Palm's ability, Black Widow,

70
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,000
turns her hair into a weapon

71
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:51,000
However, what made Black Widow frightening

72
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,000
[groans]

73
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:18,000
Whoa! Hey! Miss Palm, please,
you've gotta stop using your Hatsu!

74
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,000
[Killua] Palm is originally an Enhancer.

75
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:26,000
The difference it makes when your ability
is a perfect match is incredible.

76
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:35,000
If the fight drags on,
I'm totally done for.

77
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:39,000
But even so, I can't run away.

78
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:43,000
I can tell that Gon's mind
is already at its limit.

79
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:45,000
And while he sits there waiting for Pitou,

80
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:47,000
he's barely holding himself together.

81
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:53,000
[chuckles]

82
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,000
and if there is…

83
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:07,000
it's not gonna help.

84
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,000
[rumbling]

85
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,000
[groans]

86
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Huh? Why are you asking now?

87
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:39,000
There's no reason, actually.
I just want to see him.

88
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,000
He's probably nearby.

89
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:44,000
Don't worry. I'll find him myself.

90
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Just as soon as I've killed you, that is!

91
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,000
Sorry!

92
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:02,000
I panicked earlier,
and I called you the enemy.

93
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:05,000
You might look different,
but you're still Palm, aren't you?

94
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,000
[gasps]

95
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:15,000
That person had his soul taken away,

96
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:18,000
and right now, Gon is facing off

97
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,000
against the person who's responsible.

98
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,000
If he sees you now,

99
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:25,000
looking so different
than you did before…

100
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
[gasps]

101
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,000
Gon is gonna totally snap.

102
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,000
So when you see him…

103
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:49,000
make sure you call him by his name first.

104
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
That's it. That's my condition.

105
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Before we entered the palace,

106
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,000
Gon was really worried about you.

107
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,000
He told me that himself.

108
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,000
So, please, give him some peace of mind.

109
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,000
[narrator] He was just buying time.

110
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,000
He had no intention of letting them meet,

111
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,000
at least, not at first.

112
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,000
[Killua crying]

113
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:48,000
[Killua] Please, if you can…

114
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:51,000
put his mind at ease.

115
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:56,000
Please, only you…

116
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,000
can do that now, Palm.

117
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,000
No one else…

118
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,000
can reach him.

119
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,000
It's all up to you now.

120
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,000
I just…

121
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:43,000
[continues wailing]

122
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Look. He's defenseless.

123
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:59,000
So, new strategy, kill him now,
Number One.

124
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,000
[dramatic music playing]

125
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Surrounded by the brutally evil aura,

126
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:23,000
she felt as though
she would soon be crushed to dust,

127
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,000
and, in an instant,

128
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:28,000
came to the very same conclusion
that Knov had.

129
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:35,000
Then as she watched Pouf slowly
and silently descend the stairs,

130
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,000
As one cannot help but shiver in the cold,

131
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:57,000
no one could blame Palm
for reflexively using her own aura

132
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:10,000
who agreed to forego a meal,

133
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:14,000
Pitou and Pouf made her
experimental soldier Number One.

134
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:18,000
Those who remembered their pasts

135
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,000
had shown stronger mental fortitude
than the others.

136
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,000
This phenomenon was most noticeable

137
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:27,000
in Ants who possessed Nen abilities.

138
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:30,000
It was becoming clear
that memories of the past

139
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:34,000
had a tendency to both assist
and deter the soldiers' growth.

140
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:52,000
to destroy the connection
between Palm's memories and her emotions.

141
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:55,000
The experiments on Cheetu and Leol

142
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:58,000
confirmed that those
who retained more of their memories

143
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:02,000
emerged from their cocoons
much sooner than their counterparts.

144
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:09,000
would be to leave soldiers
with their memories

145
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:12,000
while maintaining
strict control over them.

146
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:18,000
As it happened,
Palm was the perfect guinea pig.

147
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:21,000
The success of the experiment

148
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:42,000
Palm Siberia.

149
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:44,000
[gasps]

150
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Don't call me "Number One"!

151
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:52,000
[dramatic music playing]

152
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:22,000
[gasps]

153
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,000
Thank you, Killua.

154
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:31,000
I owe it all to you.

155
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,000
and there was nothing I could do.

156
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:46,000
It was like that ever since I woke up.

157
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,000
[gasps]

158
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,000
If it means helping Gon,

159
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:04,000
I'm ready to do anything in my power.

160
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,000
But please don't forget,

161
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,000
[Shaiapouf groans]

162
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:33,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] What is it?

163
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,000
[Shaiapouf] Total failure,

164
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:37,000
and that's all there is to it.

165
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:38,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Huh?

166
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:57,000
If it's soldiers I require,
I can create them on my own.

167
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,000
In fact, that will make it much easier

168
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:41,000
Wait. But this is mine.

169
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:42,000
Oh, well.

170
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
